Put Key "a'comment'b"+Chr$(1)+Chr$(3)+Chr$(69)+"c"+"d"
A$="" : For I=1 To 6 : K$=Inkey$ : A$=A$+K$+"/"+Str$(Scancode)+Str$(Scanshift)+";" : Next I : Print #1,A$
Put Key "x'unterminated" : Print #1,"[";Inkey$;"][";Inkey$;"]"
Key$(3)="Run`Edit`"+Chr$(1)+"abc"+"z" : Key$(4)=String$("w",40) : Key$(5)="`````````````"
For I=3 To 5 : A$=Key$(I) : B$="" : For J=1 To Len(A$) : B$=B$+Str$(Asc(Mid$(A$,J))) : Next J : Print #1,Len(A$);B$ : Next I
Key Speed 10,2 : Key Speed 25,5
Print #1,"end"
